flowchart TD
    Shortcut[Hold / tap / double-tap] --> Audio[Local microphone and speech model]
    Companion[Compact companion / expanded dock] --> Audio
    Audio --> Match{Explicit action or snippet?}
    Match -->|Action| Launch[Approved app or website]
    Match -->|Snippet| Paste[Destination text field]
    Match -->|Normal dictation| Cleanup[Optional selected AI provider]
    Cleanup --> Format[Local formatting / learned pairs / explicit corrections]
    Format --> Paste
    Paste --> Gate{Local learning enabled / supported Mac field?}
    Gate -->|Yes| Watch[Observe only this field / 90 sec maximum]
    Watch -->|Focus changed or new dictation| Stop[Discard transient field text]
    Watch -->|Stable single-word spelling edit| Pair[Store only old/new word locally]
    Pair --> Review[Writing / Keep now or remove]
    Pair -->|Same edit in two dictations| Active[Active personal correction]
    Review -->|Keep| Active
    Active --> Format
    Gate -->|No| Stop
